<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market not tested-USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market not tested-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Confirmed -  None   Week Ago -  None   Year Ago -    700</p>
<p>Wk to Date - None   Week Ago - 1,100   Year Ago - 13,400</p>
